<title>AUSTRIA: OPEC ministers assemble for Thursday meeting.</title>
<headline>OPEC ministers assemble for Thursday meeting.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>OPEC ministers began to assemble at the group's Secretariat building on Thursday for the second session of the current meeting, expected to be the last.</p>
<p>Minister have expressed support for a rollover of the current 25.033 million barrels per day ceiling with many expecting the rollover to be for six months.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
</text>
